'''The Battle of Hoth''' was a game published in [[Star Wars Gamer 6|''Star Wars Gamer'' 6]] in [[2001]], featuring the [[Battle of Hoth/Legends|Battle of Hoth]]. It is setup as a historical simulation for [[New Republic/Legends|New Republic]] [[officer]] [[Cadet/Legends|cadets]] sponsored by [[General]] [[Blake (Rebel)|Blake]].

It can be played with 1-2 players, and is played with paper tokens on a hex mat. Each unit has its own card with its characteristics, and is played over three rounds.

